      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "False Transparency in Government",
      "description": "Government agencies and schools exhibit a disconnect with their constituencies, presenting a 'false flag' of transparency that leaves communities feeling ignored without understanding how aggregate sentiment is utilized.",
