      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Implementation Outpaces Educational Scaffolding",
      "description": "When administrators deploy new ranked-choice voting structures without providing sufficient public education or unbiased candidate data, voters are left confused by the mechanics and unable to adapt their voting behavior.",
